menu "Moby firmware"

config MOBY_F1_LED_TEST
    bool "Enable F1 bench test for the red LED"
    default n
    help
        During a bench test, turn on GPIO21 for an accepted Talk press while
        the physical switch enables the microphone path. Disable before normal use, where
        the red LED is reserved for an audio capture session.

config MOBY_F2_MIC_TEST
    bool "Enable F2 bench test for the INMP441 microphone"
    depends on !MOBY_F1_LED_TEST
    default n
    help
        Capture while Talk is held and the physical microphone path is enabled.
        Report aggregate PCM levels over UART after an authorized bench capture.

endmenu
